Priority: P2 | Area: docs | Labels: docs,area:docs,P2 | Milestone: v0.1.0 | RFC: OQ-053 | Task: CTX-0003

Cross-repo work for bitty CTX-0426 (official plugin onboarding order and registration policy). Owner repo: bitty-plugins-docs.

Deliverable: product/official-plugin-onboarding.md (document_type policy, status normative) covering:
- official versus community boundary and entry criteria;
- registration checklist (template repo, SDK lint clean, capability review, docs page set, minimal registry entry, submodule pinned to a mainline commit, regenerate + validate);
- bundled-split order of operations (port -> register -> remove bundled -> docs sync) with merge-order hazards: stacked-base auto-close (bitty-plugins PR #6 merged with branch deletion auto-closed child PR #7 at 2026-09-14T05:44:25Z; recovered as PR #9) and the rule to never delete a base branch while a child PR uses it; shared-artifact conflicts in generated/registry.json and .gitmodules;
- version and compatibility policy; review requirements (independent reviewer, different agent); maintenance rules (pin bumps, deprecation/removal, security review triggers).

Also update docs/README.md navigation. Cross-link product/bundled-plugin-split-decision.md (accepted) and cite the observed PR sequence as the recorded lesson. Do not edit product/plugin-roadmap.md or the split decision record while bitty-plugins-docs PR #9 (CTX-0424) is open.

Acceptance: just check green, git diff --check clean, PR linked to the bitty-plugins registry PR and bitty CTX-0426, no merge.
